Z||000004||trigger||04-03-2001||09:31 PM||||hi,<BR>guess what. I am just finishing writing a research paper for my sophmore english class. (english 10)  I ordered Gary's Witzenburgs book and I couldn't have done the paper without it.  I also got some stuff off of FieroLisa's page.  Thanks Lisa.  For our paper we had to use parenthetical documentation and the whole nine yard's. You're lucky 30 people understand Fieros, I have about 5 of my friends that understand Fieros, the others make crap out of me cause my Fiero is faster than their cars.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>Check the Search for about 10 or so days ago and you should find my post.  Hope this helps.  E-mail me if you have any questions.  Have fun writing it, I learned a lot.<P>------------------<BR>Honestly officer, I was just keeping up with the flow of traffic.  I know there aren't any cars in the area, that's how far behind I am.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Trigger.gif"> ||||reg||10
